<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Foreigners net buyers of S.Africa shares last week.</title>
<headline>Foreigners net buyers of S.Africa shares last week.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Johannesburg Stock Exchange (JSE) said non-residents were net buyers of 768.58 million rand's worth of South African shares last week.</p>
<p>Non-resident transactions (million rand) -</p>
<p>			   Week to June 13    Year to date  Year ago</p>
<p>Equities:</p>
<p>- purchases		    1,529.03     28,708.48     19,969.39</p>
<p>- sales			    760.45     18,624.71     16,305.52</p>
<p>- net purchases/(sales)	768.58     10,083.78	3,663.88</p>
<p>NOTE - The figures reflect only the portion of the market where non-resident transactions are executed through the JSE, and are therefore not comprehensive.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
